note: a measured count was one cause amplified, not many causes — one
  severed chain, one dead head, or one repeated misread fired N identical
  diagnostics and each logged its own row. Declares that frequency-rank
  over raw rows misranks; split by burst/episode before triage. First
  measured instance: KORU010, 308 of 326 systemic rows in bursts ≥3.
